        "parms": "# div swap pong — whole parts, crossed pairs, folding\ndiv divides and keeps the whole part, as an int, and % gives what is left over. swap sends a pair out crossed: the number from its left inlet leaves the right outlet, then the one from its right inlet leaves the left outlet. pong keeps a number between two limits by folding it back from them, wrapping it round, or clipping it.\nMax has no div: its / divides whole numbers this way. Here / always sends a float, so use div, which truncates toward zero.",
